ModuPort licensing review notice
================================

This repository is a public-release candidate, not a licensed public release.

No open-source licence is granted by this file. Redistribution, publication,
or relicensing of the bundled frozen numerical dependencies is not authorised
until ownership and licensing have been confirmed for the source groups listed
in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

The project maintainers must replace this notice with an approved licence and
complete the dependency review before making the repository public.

